<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech cuts VA Stahl stake.</title>
<headline>VA Tech cuts VA Stahl stake.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian engineering group VA Technologie AG said on Friday it had cut its stake in VA Stahl AG by one percent to 20.31 percent, in accordance with its strategy of gradually reducing its interest in the steelmaker.</p>
<p>&quot;With the declared intention of reducing the investment in Voest-Alpine Stahl AG below a 20 percent limit, VA Technologie AG has recently sold 300,000 of its shares in Voest-Alpine Stahl,&quot; VA Tech said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
